{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1035.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"18e0bd1a972eeee0b09daedc3d9dd9478f99458375ab87358155888d1802e8c8","ja":"大忙しの可奈！","zh":"忙碌的可奈！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1035.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"28f0c73ce4ff00f2864545dd8bf3e34f297dc855e7a3112e0ee3c672a3c5d311","ja":"レッスン終わって、ヘッロヘロ～♪\nだけどこれからお仕事だ、頑張ろ～♪","zh":"上完训练课，累得软绵绵～♪\n不过接下来还有工作，要加油啦～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1035.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"987c99acbbae29995bd924176d9914f31deea34f7d374e7389a1522278db8ce3","ja":"お疲れ、可奈！\n居残りレッスンまでして、ずいぶん熱心だな。","zh":"辛苦了，可奈！\n还留下来自主加练，真够热心的啊。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1035.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"73cf40febac693eaa758a1c8f1b4f9512343a9dbb94e9c9ec86b8009679799a0","ja":"えへへ～……。\nまだ、途中のステップがうまくできなくって……。","zh":"嘿嘿～……\n中间有一段舞步我还跳得不太好……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1035.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"7e29d506af352e2fb45917a9575a2a9d42073608e5e62b800a73d8288c19704e","ja":"……ととっ！","zh":"……哎呀呀！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1035.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"742494c2fa58d52c6d6722673d6189f5d4d5d3aef866ed9d6e91b91f39b2e53b","ja":"お、おい！\nなんかフラフラしてるけど、大丈夫か！？","zh":"喂、喂！\n你脚步看起来有点晃，没事吧！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1035.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"08f02d6071ff75744c86472dd3a2343b3a3140216467b34c93c439c35ff585e9","ja":"は、はい。\nただ、ちょっと疲れが溜まっちゃってたかも……？","zh":"是、是的。\n只是可能稍微积攒了些疲劳……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1035.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"2ae9a9d630127c79d419d36bbce95b081e364d67ec45a0821075aac27ca45d1c","ja":"来月、合唱コンクールがあるんです。\nそれで合唱部の練習も忙しくなってて……。","zh":"下个月要开合唱比赛了。\n所以合唱团的练习也变得忙碌起来……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1035.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"0688cb39f527e13ff81244867fba42ac06fdb8c57eb88c93f36ddf7df8c724a3","ja":"頑張っててすごいね！\nけど、部活の練習も多いと大変じゃない？","zh":"你真努力，太厉害了！\n不过，社团练习也很多的话，不会很辛苦吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1035.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"708d5da5b69e254f6bd3e235f586dd3368f88ee2bc59341ca89d15b4667bd812","ja":"お休みも……大事……。\n倒れちゃダメ……だから……。","zh":"休息也……很重要……。\n不能累倒……哦……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1035.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"e00bb953293b073472f40717b611887faec49402234b287f01ade7f692cdfe1b","ja":"うん、でも本当に大丈夫だから！\nそれじゃあ、お仕事行ってきまーす！","zh":"嗯，但我真的没事啦！\n那我出发去工作喽——！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1035.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e","ja":"数日後……","zh":"几天后……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1035.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"3efba112eaa2951bd0d7782ebc2154f82ccbcbfafdd92639a40b8c9d36c8252a","ja":"可奈、この間のステップなんだけどさ……\nあたしのまとめた動画でよかったら参考にしてくれよ。","zh":"可奈，关于前阵子的舞步……\n不嫌弃的话，可以参考一下我整理的视频哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1035.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"a073a6e6f643c324d95b30eb71e46c7ec4b1dc08a603ec42be853a03b890a341","ja":"空き時間に見るだけでも、\nコツがつかめるかと思ってさ。","zh":"我想着就算只是在空闲时看看，\n也能掌握到诀窍呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1035.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"704d9d3536cfb36de196135251ee63cffabf5e7964434165605bb6b5301d3993","ja":"わあっ、編集してくれたんですか！？\n助かります～！","zh":"哇，帮我编辑好了吗！？\n帮大忙了～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1035.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"2547e8272a42d358e7282c246d9179770dc55f0f00043e038cc6d4fd9428e557","ja":"じゃあ、私からも……歌のレッスンのときに\n気づいたこと、まとめたんだ。","zh":"那我也来……这是我在唱歌练习时\n注意到的地方，总结了一下。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1035.unity3d","item_key":"commands[40].text","source_sha256":"da119f1195887b1f776bc06c5224bfbb886f58e64b4edd98288f42f447bf0593","ja":"可奈ちゃんが歌いづらそうにしてたところ、\nこうしたらどうかなって。","zh":"可奈唱得有些吃力的地方，\n我想这样处理会不会比较好。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1035.unity3d","item_key":"commands[41].text","source_sha256":"bb0b751187ad6d7ffcf38db50d07c008a41e572dc68fe81881f6b27422ad3f1f","ja":"すごい、こんなに細かく……\n私、絶対歌えるようになってみせますねっ！","zh":"好厉害，这么细致……\n我一定会练到能唱出来的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1035.unity3d","item_key":"commands[49].text","source_sha256":"ad39f1c2172e1a87379437d5a66102a51e675befa906359435a964f3a26fe3fe","ja":"（ジュリアさんも……春香さんも……\nとっても、サポート上手……）","zh":"（茱莉亚也是……春香也是……\n都非常擅长支持别人……）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1035.unity3d","item_key":"commands[50].text","source_sha256":"57f9c6c7451d7be746c6543d124d377cfbb09c96d09610e95ae491a7a60d1de7","ja":"（杏奈も……頑張ってる可奈のために……\n何か……できたら、いいな……！）","zh":"（杏奈也……想为努力着的可奈……\n做点什么……要是能帮上忙就好了……！）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
